The '''Steampunk Texture Pack'''<ref>{{Cite|url=https://news.xbox.com/2014/10/28/games-halloween-steampunk-packs-minecraft-xbox/|title=Build Steampunk and Spooky Halloween Worlds with New Minecraft Texture Packs|author=Xbox Wire Staff|date=October 28, 2014|website=Xbox Wire}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20141206103345/http://www.microsoftstudiosblog.com/minecraft-checking-out-the-new-texture-packs/|title=Minecraft: Checking Out The New Texture Packs|date=October 29, 2014|author=USN Saint|website=Microsoft Studios Blog}}</ref><ref>{{Mcnet|marketplace-gets-infinity-dungeon-skins-and-steampunk|Marketplace gets Infinity Dungeon, skins and steampunk!|August 3, 2017|Marsh Davies}}</ref> is a [[texture pack (downloadable content)|texture pack]] that customizes the game with {{w|steampunk}}-themed textures.

